# scope-types.test.ts type-checks generated fixtures in a throwaway project beside the package —
# inside it, so `../src/index.ts` resolves as a sibling does, and outside `src/` so `pnpm
# typecheck` never sees a fixture that is MEANT to fail. It is removed in a `finally`; this covers
# the run that is killed before the finally.
